				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				289
			</span></i>. Adv.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.245
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.747d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.267
			</span></i>.</div>
